; board-add.sabra — the board chapter's create call site (board.borg L5).
;
; Pure vocabulary over the v0.3 prelude row todo-add: the page hands
; path/title/who/when as run inputs (rim-encoded cstr/cstr/cstr/int),
; the program does the one journaled tree/put.  Eta-wrapped because the
; diff-corpus twin pins DIRECT def applications: the def itself is
; todo-add; this program is the BOARD's callsite over it.
;
; Every mutation run must come back status normal, denial_count 0,
; replay-verify verified - the F5 wire carried from defs to programs.

(lambda (path)
  (lambda (title)
    (lambda (who)
      (lambda (when)
        (todo-add path title who when)))))
